{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1409840-was-there-a-way-to-increase-breading-in-2rd-edition","id":1409840,"title":"Was there a way to increase Breading in 2rd Edition?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-08-22T17:29:39-07:00","id":1409840,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon5.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Was there a way to increase Breading in 2rd Edition?","content":"I thought there was a Charm for it, but I can't find it.<br /> <br /> What new ways would you allow a Dragon Blood to increase their Breeding Background?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-22T17:56:44-07:00","id":1409841,"title":"","content":"Purity Crucible Strike, page 103 of Dreams of the First Age: Lords of Creation. It lets you strike a mortal and kill them instantly, or strike a DB and let them roll to increase their breeding, failing the roll results in death.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-22T18:24:09-07:00","id":1409843,"title":"","content":"To increase Breeding, yeah, DrLoveMonkey is right.<br /> <br /> \u200bFor the more important question, that of increasing <i>breading</i>, you'll want to double-batter your food. So first apply the egg wash, then roll your food in the bread crumbs, then a quick hop in the fryer long enough to get the coating fairly solid, then <i>back</i> in the egg wash, then back in the bread crumbs again, and then another hop in the fryer.<br /> <br /> \u200bDon't forget to use the &quot;wet hand, dry hand&quot; technique to keep your fingers from getting super messy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":20}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-27T17:04:28-07:00","id":1410784,"title":"","content":"I'd imagine that Raksi would be your best bet to increase Dragon-Blooded Breading. No matter the edition, she has likely researched it extensively.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-27T17:14:04-07:00","id":1410786,"title":"","content":"words can't even begin to express my disappointment when I saw what lay beyond the header of this post<br /> <br /> It's a narrative benefit. Whatever ways might exist, they are likely esoteric in nature. There also might be a lot of stuff people say you should do in the Dynasty that might just be fads. Creation is full of interesting things like that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Violet Green, Freelancer</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23657-violetdreamer","name":"VioletDreamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23657_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-28T07:49:10-07:00","id":1410848,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>VioletDreamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1409840-was-there-a-way-to-increase-breading-in-2rd-edition?p=1410786#post1410786\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There also might be a lot of stuff people say you should do in the Dynasty that might just be fads. Creation is full of interesting things like that.</div> </div> </div> </div><s>The fact the first such hypothetical thing to come to mind is a complex set of recommendations for who should be on top based on sex/aspect combination proves I\u2019m a Gutter Aspect, I guess.</s>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","